BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1b647eed248eb77c1cf1e936
SUMMARY:Niladri Kumaar: The Space Between the Notes 
DTSTAMP:20260926T080420Z
DTSTART:20261014T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:a { text-decoration: none\; color: #464feb\; } tr th\, tr td { 
	border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\; } tr th { background-color: #f5f5f5\; } Sitar 
	Maestro Niladri Kumaar is hailed as a maverick musician and composer\, a c
	elebrated cultural ambassador\, and an icon of Indian music. One of the mo
	st compelling and innovative artists of his generation\, he is a devoted e
	xponent of Indian classical music—widely regarded as a source of national 
	pride and among the most sought-after Indian musicians today. He frequentl
	y collaborated with the late Zakir Hussain\, and together their sitar–tabl
	a duo became one of their most popular and celebrated musical partnerships
	. Space Between the Notes is an extraordinary live recording of these two 
	maestros in concert in Mumbai\, India. Set for release later this year\, i
	t stands as their only recorded performance together. Honoring the musical
	 tradition they shared\, Kumaar continues to expand the global reach of In
	dian music with a specially curated 2026–2027 concert tour featuring his s
	itar\, zitar\, and an ensemble of Indian and American musicians. Kumaar we
	aves his signature\, spellbinding melodies in a distinctive style that ble
	nds centuries-old tradition with bold creative innovation. The tour also p
	ays tribute to the unique musical bond between these two masters through s
	elections from their album\, presented live on stage. Space Between the No
	tes is a powerful musical journey—rooted in tradition and certain to reson
	ate deeply with audiences.\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail
	/niladri-kumaar
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/niladri-kumaar
LOCATION:Jarson-Kaplan Theater\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Concerts
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a6d01202242bd4ce32ae62db
SUMMARY:The Sixties Show
DTSTAMP:20260926T080420Z
DTSTART:20261016T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:a { text-decoration: none\; color: #464feb\; } tr th\, tr td { 
	border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\; } tr th { background-color: #f5f5f5\; } The Si
	xties Show from New York City is hailed as “The Greatest 1960s Musical Re-
	Creation Show on Earth!” This popular\, award-winning off-Broadway product
	ion is a high-energy\, multimedia\, immersive experience that transports a
	udiences back to the 1960s through a live\, note-for-note re-creation conc
	ert. The cast features current and former band members of The Who\, The Ra
	scals\, and John Fogerty's Creedence Clearwater Revival. This cross-genera
	tional crowd-pleaser has been selling out theaters and performing arts cen
	ters across the country. The band is widely celebrated for its spot-on\, n
	ote-for-note performances of iconic hits\, B-sides\, and deep album cuts f
	rom some of the greatest songs of the 1960s. More than just a concert\, th
	is high-energy production is a large-scale\, ambitious\, multimedia stage 
	experience. It is enhanced by time-travel-themed special effects\, narrati
	on\, authentic ’60s archival audio and newsreel footage\, and a dynamic li
	ght show. This must-see\, larger-than-life production is nothing short of 
	awe-inspiring. The band utilizes a state-of-the-art sound system while per
	forming exclusively on authentic 1960s-era vintage and reissue instruments
	 – just like the original artists and recordings. Combined with genuine 19
	60s mod costumes\, this attention to detail adds to the authenticity and i
	mpact of the performance. All music is performed live\, with no samples\, 
	backing tracks\, or prerecorded elements of any kind. "An astonishing achi
	evement – The Sixties Show delivers an unforgettable hit of pure musical a
	nd storytelling brilliance!” “The music soars\, the visuals dazzle\, and t
	he crowd can’t stop cheering – this Is a show for the ages!!” “A gorgeous 
	collision of theater and rock ‘n’ roll – this show doesn’t just recreate h
	istory... it resurrectsi it!!” " A wholly original theatrical thunderclap 
	that rips open the timeline – stunning\, \n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.or
	g/events/detail/the-sixties-show
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/the-sixties-show
LOCATION:Procter & Gamble Hall\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Concerts
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:96fcb436814e8e321f448d1f
SUMMARY:Outlander in Concert: Echoes Through the Highlands
DTSTAMP:20260926T080420Z
DTSTART:20261030T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:Experience the official Outlander in-concert event! A live orch
	estra performs Bear McCreary’s acclaimed score\, curated by showrunner Mat
	thew B. Roberts\, while highlights from eight seasons illuminate the scree
	n. From Craigh na Dun to the New World\, relive Claire and Jamie’s journey
	 as Scotland’s Celtic sound takes the spotlight. Outlander in Concert cele
	brates the show’s rich heritage\, the timeless romance between Claire and 
	Jamie\, and the sweeping landscapes that made us fall in love. Premiering 
	in Scotland\, the heart and home of Outlander\, Echoes of The Highlands wi
	ll fill the air\, reminding us that this is not the end… but just the begi
	nning.\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/outlander-in-concer
	t
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/outlander-in-concert
LOCATION:Procter & Gamble Hall\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Concerts
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4a9586b7213787bdc94971f0
SUMMARY:Disney's Frozen Movie Sing-Along
DTSTAMP:20260926T080420Z
DTSTART:20261107T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Disney's FROZEN Movie Sing-Along with Special Guest Hostess "Ic
	e Princess Tara" Get ready to “Let It Go” and sing your heart out as Sing‑
	Along Live! brings Disney’s beloved hit Frozen to the big screen — complet
	e with on‑screen lyrics\, audience participation moments\, and a magical l
	ive introduction from Ice Princess Tara - our sparkling hostess for both s
	hows. Tara takes the stage before the film to welcome families\, warm up t
	he crowd\, and invite everyone to join the adventure. Her enchanting prese
	nce sets the perfect tone as Anna\, Elsa\, Olaf\, and the entire kingdom o
	f Arendelle come to life in this interactive musical event. Sing along to 
	all your favorite songs\, including “Do You Want to Build a Snowman\,” “Lo
	ve Is an Open Door\,” and the global phenomenon “Let It Go.” Costumes are 
	encouraged\, voices are required\, and the magic is guaranteed. Bring the 
	whole family and experience Frozen like never before — as a joyful\, high‑
	energy\, community sing‑along celebration.\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.o
	rg/events/detail/disneys-frozen-movie-sing-along
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/disneys-frozen-movie-sing-
	along
LOCATION:Jarson-Kaplan Theater\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Concerts
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
